// Power Help Text :
"P659479324" "You hack your target with a blade formed from within your mind. This manifested blade causes psionic damage and leaves injuries that cause additional lethal damage over time. The target also suffers a reduction in their attack speed, chance to hit, regeneration and recovery. The target may also be taunted to attack you if they are not already doing so."
