// Power Help Text :
"P84691991" "Your mind exerts an extremely powerful hold over your body, naturally increasing your regeneration rate, attack speed and chance to hit. Moreover, your force of will makes attacks that would reduce these attributes or your movement speeds less effective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mental Breakdown 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4130858183" "Mental Breakdown"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3383677014" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), High DMG (Psionic), Minor DoT (Psionic), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe), +RES(Foe, Heal), Heal(Self)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2169729609" "You create a powerful illusion in the minds of your targets, causing them to become rapidly hyperstressed. This causes a cascading reaction in the mind that causes psionic damage. The effects of this reaction linger, causing additional psionic damage over time. Additionally, affected targets suffer reduced regeneration, recovery and healing effectiveness. Finally, the endorphins released within your own body as the success of your attack heal you."
